The charge further states that the revenue entries in respect of non ZA land could not be corrected under Section 33/39 of the U.P. Land Revenue Act;
rather such errors can be corrected under the provisions of U.P. Urban Area Zamindari Abolition Act and as such respondent no.1-petitioner had acted without jurisdiction while passing the order correcting the revenue records on the application preferred by the person concerned.
